# Build context = repository root (see infra/docker/*.Dockerfile).
# Keep secrets, VCS metadata, host-built artefacts and caches OUT of images.

# VCS / CI / editor
.git
.github
.claude
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp

# Secrets — never in an image (pydantic reads apps/api/.env if present!)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/key.properties
**/secrets
**/*.dump
**/*.dump.*
backups

# Python caches / test output
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/coverage
apps/api/tests

# Node — host node_modules must not overwrite the in-image `npm ci` result
# (native binaries differ between glibc hosts and the musl/alpine image).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/npm-debug.log*
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Mobile app is not part of any server image
apps/mobile

# Local tooling / data
.local
**/pgdata
**/*.log

# Docs are not needed at runtime
*.md
docs
